          "level": 1,
          "content": "EXPRESSIONS 4 USING LETTER-NUMBERS"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.783,
            0.062,
            0.905,
            0.149
          ],
          "content": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.82,
            0.153,
            0.869,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "0774CH04"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.298,
            0.624,
            0.322
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "4.1 The Notion of Letter-Numbers"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.331,
            0.848,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": "In this chapter we shall look at a concise way of expressing mathematical relations and patterns. We shall see how this helps us in thinking about these relationships and patterns, and in explaining why they may hold true."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.415,
            0.848,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": "? **Example 1:** Shabnam is 3 years older than Aftab. When Aftab’s age 10 years, Shabnam’s age will be 13 years. Now Aftab’s age is 18 years, what will Shabnam’s age be?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.487,
            0.71,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": "？ Given Aftab’s age, how will you find out Shabnam’s age?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.519,
            0.658,
            0.54
          ],
          "content": "Easy: We add 3 to Aftab’s age to get Shabnam’s age."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.547,
            0.511,
            0.57
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Can we write this as an expression?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.578,
            0.848,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "Shabnam’s age is 3 years more than Aftab’s. In short, this can be written as:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.616,
            0.51,
            0.634
          ],
          "content": "**Shabnam’s age = Aftab’s age + 3.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.635,
            0.553,
            0.764
          ],
          "content": "Such mathematical relations are generally represented in a shorthand form. In the relation above, instead of writing the phrase ‘Aftab’s Age’, the convention is to use a convenient symbol. Usually, letters or short phrases are used for this purpose."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.763,
            0.553,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": "Let us say we use the letter a to denote Aftab’s age (we could have used any other letter), and s to denote Shabnam’s age. Then the expression to"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.57,
            0.631,
            0.863,
            0.798
          ],
          "content": "| Aftab's age | Expression for Shabnam's age |\n| --- | --- |\n| 4 10 | 4+3 10 + 3 |\n| 23 | 23+3 |\n| ? | ?+ 3 |\n| a | a + 3 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_table_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.681,
            0.814,
            0.747,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": "F i g . ~ 4 . 1",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.836,
            0.72,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "find Shabnam’s age will be a + 3, which can be written as"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.453,
            0.861,
            0.545,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "s = a + 3 .",
          "image_source": "images/page_0_equation_16.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.884,
            0.745,
            0.905
          ],
          "content": "If a is 23 (Aftab’s age in years), then what is Shabnam’s age?"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.448,
